          "items": [
            "HOLIDAY SPECIAL!! $100 GROCERY DELIVERY CREDIT:<br>Let us help you celebrate for the holidays! For NEW reservations made after Nov 9th with check-in date being during the timeframes of November 10th, 2025- January 5th, 2026 you will receive $100 credit towards grocery delivery!<br>Here is how it works: After you book the property we will email you a link to order groceries for your stay with a promo code that will give you $100 off your order! Our shoppers will shop your order, deliver it to the property and have it put away before you arrive!<br><br>KEY HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- 3 min walk to the Beach Access <br>- 0.5 miles to Seaside Town Square<br>- Elevator<br>- Observation Tower<br>- 2 Dishwashers<br>- Private Pool - Pool Heat can be purchased for an additional $55/day<br>- Sonos Speakers<br>- In home gym with Peloton & Stair Master<br>- Screen in porches<br>- Grill<br>- Firepit<br>- 5 Bikes <br><br>Discover pure tranquility at Serenity Now, an exquisite coastal cottage boasting 5 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms, accommodating up to 12 guests. This luxurious retreat offers panoramic Gulf views, a private gym, 2 outdoor decks, a serene pool with a fountain and fire pit, and comes complete with 5 bicycles for convenient exploration of nearby Seaside attractions, restaurants, shops, and beach access just a short stroll away.<br><br>Step into this haven on the second floor to find a harmonious blend of living, kitchen, and dining spaces adorned with hardwood accents, coastal flair, and direct access to an outdoor deck. A private sitting room leads to a guest bedroom with a king bed and en-suite bathroom. The kitchen, with premium appliances and elegant marble-topped islands, flows seamlessly into the dining area and living room, featuring a cozy fireplace and French doors opening to a screened porch with dining and seating areas overlooking the pool.<br><br>On the first floor, guests can revel in privacy with a bunk room, a guest bedroom with a king bed and sleeper sofa, and a pool deck equipped with various amenities including a fire pit, loungers, grill, and outdoor shower. The pool area offers a sundeck and a mesmerizing fountain with an integrated fire pit.<br><br>Ascending to the third floor unveils a guest bedroom with a vaulted ceiling and king bed, alongside a primary bedroom designed as a personal sanctuary within this lavish coastal haven. The primary bedroom features a king 4-poster bed, a private living room, and access to a balcony with French doors leading to a covered deck with stunning Gulf views, ideal for intimate dinners under the stars.<br><br>Experience the charm of Seaside and Seagrove Beach with 5 complimentary adult bikes included for guests to explore the surroundings.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 16):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>Bunk Bedroom: Two Full-over-Twin Bunk Beds, Shared Bathroom With Shower Only<br>Guest Bedroom: King Bed with Queen Sleeper Sofa, Shared Bathroom With Shower Only<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom With Shower Only<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom With Shower and Tub<br>Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom With Shower Only<br><br>BIKES:<br>This home comes equipped with 5 bikes for your enjoyment. <br><br>PRIVATE POOL:<br>The pool can be heated for an additional $55/day. Please contact us to coordinate. <br><br>GARAGE:<br>Unfortunately, the garage is not available for guest use. <br><br>GOLF CARTS:<br>This home does not come with a golf cart. If you would like to rent one please reach out to us to coordinate. <br><br>*During Spring Break and Summer there are Saturday - Saturday booking restrictions that apply.*",
